<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>0G AI Alignment Node - Claim Checker</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .header p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .search-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .search-form {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .search-form input {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            border: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
            border-radius: 10px;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }

        .search-form input:focus {
            border-color: #667eea;
        }

        .search-form button {
            padding: 15px 40px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        }

        .search-form button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4);
        }

        .search-form button:disabled {
            opacity: 0.6;
            cursor: not-allowed;
            transform: none;
        }

        .loading {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px;
            color: #667eea;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            display: none;
        }

        .loading.active {
            display: block;
        }

        .spinner {
            border: 3px solid #f3f3f3;
            border-top: 3px solid #667eea;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
            margin: 0 auto 15px;
        }

        @keyframes spin {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        .error {
            background: #fee;
            color: #c33;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: none;
        }

        .error.active {
            display: block;
        }

        .results {
            display: none;
        }

        .results.active {
            display: block;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .card h2 {
            color: #333;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #f0f0f0;
        }

        .info-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .info-item {
            padding: 15px;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .info-label {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .info-value {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #333;
        }

        .info-value.highlight {
            color: #667eea;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        .info-value.success {
            color: #10b981;
        }

        .info-value.warning {
            color: #f59e0b;
        }

        .milestone-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .milestone-table th,
        .milestone-table td {
            padding: 12px 8px;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }

        .milestone-table th {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .milestone-table td:nth-child(5),
        .milestone-table td:nth-child(6) {
            background: #f9fafb;
        }

        .milestone-table th:nth-child(6) {
            background: #667eea;
            color: white;
        }

        .milestone-table tr.current {
            background: #f0f4ff;
        }

        .milestone-table tr.current td {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #667eea;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .badge.current {
            background: #667eea;
            color: white;
        }

        .badge.past {
            background: #e0e0e0;
            color: #666;
        }

        .badge.future {
            background: #fff3cd;
            color: #856404;
        }

        .owner-address {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            word-break: break-all;
        }

        .note {
            background: #e8f4f8;
            border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-top: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #1e40af;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            margin-top: 40px;
            opacity: 0.8;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .footer a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>🎯 0G AI Alignment Node</h1>
            <p>Check Your NFT Claim Status</p>
        </div>

        <div class="search-card">
            <form class="search-form" id="searchForm">
                <input
                    type="text"
                    id="nftIdInput"
                    placeholder="Enter NFT ID (e.g., 122220)"
                    required
                    pattern="[0-9]+"
                >
                <button type="submit" id="searchButton">Check Status</button>
            </form>
        </div>

        <div class="loading" id="loading">
            <div class="spinner"></div>
            Loading NFT data...
        </div>

        <div class="error" id="error"></div>

        <div class="results" id="results">
            <!-- NFT Info Card -->
            <div class="card">
                <h2>📋 NFT Information</h2>
                <div class="info-grid">
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <div class="info-label">NFT ID</div>
                        <div class="info-value" id="nftId">-</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <div class="info-label">NFT Details</div>
                        <div class="info-value" id="ownerAddress">-</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <div class="info-label">Total Allocation</div>
                        <div class="info-value highlight" id="totalAllocation">-</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <div class="info-label">Current Penalty</div>
                        <div class="info-value warning" id="currentPenalty">-</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Part 1 Card -->
            <div class="card">
                <h2>💰 Part 1: Milestone-Based Claims (33%)</h2>
                <div class="info-grid">
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <div class="info-label">Total Part 1 Allocation</div>
                        <div class="info-value" id="part1Total">-</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <div class="info-label">Penalty-Free Amount (10%)</div>
                        <div class="info-value" id="part1PenaltyFree">-</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <div class="info-label">Already Consumed</div>
                        <div class="info-value" id="part1Consumed">-</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <div class="info-label">Already Claimed (After Penalty)</div>
                        <div class="info-value" id="part1Claimed">-</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="info-grid" style="margin-top: 20px;">
                    <div class="info-item" style="background: #f0f9ff; border: 2px solid #0284c7;">
                        <div class="info-label" style="color: #0284c7;">Remaining Claimable Share</div>
                        <div class="info-value highlight" id="part1RemainingShare">-</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-item" style="background: #ecfdf5; border: 2px solid #10b981;">
                        <div class="info-label" style="color: #059669;">Max Claimable Now (After Penalty)</div>
                        <div class="info-value success" id="part1RemainingClaimable">-</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; color: #666; font-size: 1.2rem;">📅 Milestone Schedule & Claimable Amounts</h3>
                <table class="milestone-table" id="milestoneTable">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Date</th>
                            <th>Days</th>
                            <th>Penalty</th>
                            <th>Status</th>
                            <th>Remaining Claimable</th>
                            <th>You'll Receive (After Penalty)</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody id="milestoneTableBody">
                    </tbody>
                </table>
                <div class="note" style="margin-top: 15px;">
                    <strong>How to read:</strong> "Remaining Claimable" shows your total remaining Part 1 allocation.
                    "You'll Receive" shows what you'll actually get after the penalty is applied at each milestone date.
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Part 2 Card -->
            <div class="card">
                <h2>🚀 Part 2: Linear Vesting (67%)</h2>
                <div class="info-grid">
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <div class="info-label">Total Part 2 Allocation</div>
                        <div class="info-value highlight" id="part2Total">-</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <div class="info-label">Vesting Period</div>
                        <div class="info-value">36 Months</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <div class="info-label">Daily Rate (Approx)</div>
                        <div class="info-value" id="part2DailyRate">-</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="note">
                    <strong>Note:</strong> Part 2 rewards are distributed linearly over 36 months and require active node participation.
                    Rewards may be reduced if the node is offline or non-compliant. Part 2 claims are managed separately and may not be
                    tracked by this contract.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Claim data from 0G Mainnet • NFTs on Arbitrum • <a href="https://0g.ai" target="_blank">0g.ai</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/ethers@5.7.2/dist/ethers.umd.min.js"></script>
    <script src="claim-checker.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
